{"steam_appid":3398110,"steam_name":"The Walking Trade","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3398110/394984239/5b0b9dd8d29e8d62bd1ab65f86ff3ad97560321d/1772704311/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772705383","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257298149/b3f0425af8922e0f7d31f7007bf159699718f3e8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772705383","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/1e6f90137a9faf9b7841e5204901cc5002b99ed6/ss_1e6f90137a9faf9b7841e5204901cc5002b99ed6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786621371","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/a543d307d53a61913670c0a6935f9950783b641c/ss_a543d307d53a61913670c0a6935f9950783b641c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786621371","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/e31666d184d61b8c254a69b316b20a836dae83c3/ss_e31666d184d61b8c254a69b316b20a836dae83c3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786621371","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/2f1ca1acddd008d8f72f7c867c6c753e18e0c16e/ss_2f1ca1acddd008d8f72f7c867c6c753e18e0c16e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786621371","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/a2d6b20f70a108bf8ffcbe9feb1a45724ca6e478/ss_a2d6b20f70a108bf8ffcbe9feb1a45724ca6e478.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786621371"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Walking Trade</strong> is a quirky, action-packed zombie apocalypse store management game where chaos and commerce collide!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/f21922d02f4fb021cec12e6aa2c2527f.avif?t=1786621371\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your shop, balancing space, aesthetics, and functionality. Organize shelves, set prices, and ensure customers leave happy - or at least alive.<i>  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/ab8699213a71b72c33ad31807c7fc539.poster.avif?t=1786621371\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/ab8699213a71b72c33ad31807c7fc539.webm?t=1786621371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/ab8699213a71b72c33ad31807c7fc539.mp4?t=1786621371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/dcadb8da1a15837382751338d21801cc.avif?t=1786621371\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers aren’t your only problem - zombies invade! Wield melee weapons, firearms, or whatever you can find to defend your shop during raids and hordes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/78b29bbfc98800300016d60bfc98a96c.poster.avif?t=1786621371\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/78b29bbfc98800300016d60bfc98a96c.webm?t=1786621371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/78b29bbfc98800300016d60bfc98a96c.mp4?t=1786621371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i></i><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/8183750a24a4d98b505669c948747757.avif?t=1786621371\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire survivors to scavenge supplies, serve customers, or guard the shop. Keep them equipped and motivated to reap the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/4a80ee65da96bee17680283c7af3f709.poster.avif?t=1786621371\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/4a80ee65da96bee17680283c7af3f709.webm?t=1786621371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/4a80ee65da96bee17680283c7af3f709.mp4?t=1786621371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/0d5d6aeabc5c2ebc16f9798231075484.avif?t=1786621371\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock crafting stations to create weapons, tools, and shop upgrades. Build barricades, storage units, and even makeshift traps to keep zombies at bay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/3b5541b79dad9ee4511bfc332bca2f60.poster.avif?t=1786621371\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/3b5541b79dad9ee4511bfc332bca2f60.webm?t=1786621371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/3b5541b79dad9ee4511bfc332bca2f60.mp4?t=1786621371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/40aba1f6b1e5a83b1ec656a53c2bdc69.avif?t=1786621371\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a benevolent shopkeeper or an opportunistic overlord. Help the community, price gouge, or even sabotage settlements for profit. Your reputation determines who comes knocking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/cd15cead433cba812ac0af8983cfd472.poster.avif?t=1786621371\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/cd15cead433cba812ac0af8983cfd472.webm?t=1786621371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/cd15cead433cba812ac0af8983cfd472.mp4?t=1786621371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i></i><br>In <strong>The Walking Trade</strong>, every decision shapes your survival. Build, fight, and thrive in the apocalypse—your way!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD FX-6300 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon HD 7850 with 2 GB VRAM or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD Radeon R9 280 with 4 GB VRAM or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Microwave Games"],"publishers":["PlayWay S.A."],"release_date":"5 Mar, 2026"}